# Examples

This is just a quick mockup example of what a specific requirement might look like, before and after.

## Current Requirement

This is from the [Minimum Assessment Scope](https://github.com/FedRAMP/docs/blob/main/FRMR.MAS.minimum-assessment-scope.json):

```
{
  "id": "FRR-MAS-02",
  "statement": "Providers MUST include the configuration and usage of _third-party information resources_, ONLY IF _FRR-MAS-01_ APPLIES.",
  "affects": [
    "Providers"
  ],
  "name": "Third-Party Information Resources",
  "primary_key_word": "MUST",
  "impact": {
    "low": true,
    "moderate": true,
    "high": true
  }
}
```

### Proposed Updates

With additional metadata and structure, this might look like:

```
{
  "id": "MAS-GEN-TPR",
  "fka": "FRR-MAS-02",
  "statement": "Providers MUST include the configuration and usage of third-party information resources, ONLY IF MAS-GEN-CSO (Cloud Service Offering) APPLIES.",
  "affects": [
    "Providers"
  ],
  "name": "Third-Party Information Resources",
  "primary_key_word": "MUST",
  "impact": {
    "low": true,
    "moderate": true,
    "high": true
  },
  "updated": [
    {
      "date": "2025-01-01",
      "prev": "Providers MUST be super cool about how they use third-party information resources.",
      "comment": "Clarified specific application."
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "This is really hard to understand."
  ],
  "applies": {
    "20x": {
      "is": "required",
      "effective_date": "2025-01-01",
      "corrective_actions": [
        "You might get kicked out of the pilot."
      ]
    },
    "rev5" {
      "is": "optional",
      "effective_date" "2025-01-01",
      "corrective_actions": []
    }
  },
  "assistance": {
    // insert TA object here
  }
}
```
